  id: event.engineer
  displayName: Wandering Engineer
  <Body>k__BackingField: A lone engineer in a patched-up shuttle hails you. "Nice
    ship. I could make her sing, for the right price."
  <Choices>k__BackingField:
  - Label: Tune up an item
    Requirement: 3
    RequiredScraps: 40
    Chance: 1
    Outcomes:
    - Kind: 0
      Amount: -40
      Rarity: 0
      Stat: 0
    - Kind: 6
      Amount: 0
      Rarity: 0
      Stat: 0
    FailOutcomes: []
    ResultText: She works fast and talks faster. Your ship has never felt this sharp.
    FailText: 
  - Label: Patch the hull
    Requirement: 0
    RequiredScraps: 25
    Chance: 1
    Outcomes:
    - Kind: 0
      Amount: -25
      Rarity: 0
      Stat: 0
    - Kind: 1
      Amount: 40
      Rarity: 0
      Stat: 0
    FailOutcomes: []
    ResultText: A few welds and a lot of sealant later, the hull is whole again.
    FailText: 
